    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      294.65,
      401.86,
      318.95
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Municipal Councils(Amendment) Act, No. of 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      333.65,
      401.88,
      370.91
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 5 of the Municipal Councils Ordinance(Chapter 252) is hereby repealed and the following sectionsubstituted therefor:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      385.61,
      401.85,
      409.91
    ],
    "text": "5.(1) Each Municipal Council shallconsist of such number of Councillors\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      237.57,
      424.61,
      401.88,
      487.91
    ],
    "text": "(a)as specified by the Minister by Orderpublished in the Gazette, based onthe Orders published under sections3C and 3D of the Local AuthoritiesElections Ordinance (Chapter 262);",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      237.57,
      502.61,
      401.88,
      591.95
    ],
    "text": "(b)equivalent to forty per centum of thenumber of Councillors as specifiedby the Minister by Order made underparagraph (a), who shall be returnedin terms of section 65B of the LocalAuthorities Elections Ordinance(Chapter 262); and",
